  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 190c92c32ecfb5943982286463bdd245, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NotePopUp
  letterUI: {fileID: 839769747}
  letterText: {fileID: 170560571}
  text: 'Folktale of old


    In the cold nights, when the Moon shines as bright
    as the Sun, and all nature stops its singing, this is the time when sinister
    things happen. It leaves as it came, without a sign or mention. Swiping everything
    in its way to the last, opening the closed doors, prying the chest, and emptying
    the households. The only way to know that it was somewhere is the unnatural emptiness
    left behind as a warning for others to come.'
